]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/identify-text/index.mdx","title":"テキストの識別","description":"AWS Amplifyを使用してアプリケーション内の画像とドキュメントからテキストを識別する方法を学習します。","platforms":["javascript","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/identify-text"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/identify-entity/index.mdx","title":"画像からエンティティを識別する","description":"Amplifyを使用して画像からエンティティを識別する方法を学習します。","platforms":["javascript","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/identify-entity"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/label-image/index.mdx","title":"画像内のラベルオブジェクト","description":"Amplifyを使用して画像内のラベルを検出する方法について詳しく説明します。例えば、椅子やデスクなどのオブジェクトが画像に含まれているかどうかを検出できます。","platforms":["javascript","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/label-image"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/interpret-sentiment/index.mdx","title":"センチメント分析","description":"Amplifyを使用してテキストから主要フレーズ、センチメント、言語、構文、エンティティを判定する方法を学習します。","platforms":["javascript","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/interpret-sentiment"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/example-app/index.mdx","title":"サンプルアプリケーション","description":"Amplify の Predictions カテゴリを使用するためのサンプルコード。","platforms":["javascript","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/example-app"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/sdk/index.mdx","title":"AWS SDK を使用する","description":"Amplify が機能を提供していない高度なユースケースでは、エスケープハッチを取得して AWSRekognition インスタンスにアクセスできます。","platforms":["swift","android"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/sdk"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/data-usage-policy/index.mdx","title":"データ使用ポリシー情報","description":"Amplifyライブラリが収集するデータタイプを確認してください。Appleでは、App Storeにアプリをサブミットするときにアプリのデータ使用ポリシーで開示することが必要です。","platforms":["swift"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions/data-usage-policy"}],"title":"AI/ML 予測","description":"予測カテゴリーを使用すると、機械学習の経験がなくても、アプリケーションに機械学習を統合できます。予測カテゴリーは、オンラインとオフラインの両方のユースケースをネイティブでサポートしています。","platforms":["android","angular","javascript","nextjs","react","swift","vue"],"route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/predictions","lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/index.mdx","children":[{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/set-up-analytics/index.mdx","title":"Amplify Analytics をセットアップする","description":"Analytics カテゴリでは、アプリ用の分析データを収集できます。Analytics カテゴリは Amazon Pinpoint と Amazon Kinesis（Kinesis サポートは現在のところ Amplify JavaScript ライブラリでのみ利用可能）の組み込みサポートで提供されています。Analytics カテゴリは Amazon Cognito Identity プールを使用してアプリ内のユーザーを識別します。Cognito により、アプリ内の認証済みユーザーと非認証ユーザーの両方からデータを受け取ることができます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","swift","android","flutter","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/set-up-analytics"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/record-events/index.mdx","title":"イベントの記録","description":"Amplifyを使用して分析イベントを記録する方法を学びます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","swift","android","flutter","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/record-events"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/identify-user/index.mdx","title":"ユーザーの識別","description":"Amplify analytics プラグインを使用して、Pinpoint にユーザーに関する情報を送信します。","platforms":["swift","android","flutter","javascript","react-native","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/identify-user"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/auto-track-sessions/index.mdx","title":"セッションを自動的に追跡","description":"Amplify analytics プラグインは、アプリケーションが開かれたり閉じられたりしたときを記録します。このセッション情報は、ローカルコンピュータのターミナルまたは Pinpoint の AWS コンソールから表示できます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","swift","android","flutter","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/auto-track-sessions"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/enable-disable/index.mdx","title":"アナリティクスの有効化と無効化","description":"Amplifyを使用してアナリティクスを有効/無効にする方法を学びます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","swift","android","flutter","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/enable-disable"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/streaming-data/index.mdx","title":"ストリーミング分析データ","description":"Amazon Kinesis分析プロバイダーを使用すると、分析データをAmazon Kinesisストリームに送信してリアルタイム処理を行うことができます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/streaming-data"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/storing-data/index.mdx","title":"アナリティクスデータの保存","description":"Amazon Kinesis Firehose アナリティクスプロバイダーを使用すると、アナリティクスデータを Amazon Kinesis Firehose ストリームに送信して、データを確実に保存できます。","platforms":["javascript","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/storing-data"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/personalize-recommendations/index.mdx","title":"パーソナライズされたレコメンデーション","description":"Amazon Personalizeは、イベントデータ、履歴データ、またはその両方の組み合わせを使用してレコメンデーションを作成できます。イベントデータはレコメンデーションの作成に使用できます。","platforms":["javascript","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/personalize-recommendations"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/existing-resources/index.mdx","title":"既存のAWSリソースを使用する","description":"既存のAmazon Pinpointリソースを参照して、Amplifyライブラリを設定します。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","swift","android","flutter","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/existing-resources"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/sdk/index.mdx","title":"AWS SDKを使用する","description":"Amplifyが機能を提供していない高度なユースケースでは、escape hatchを取得してAWSPinpointインスタンスにアクセスできます。","platforms":["swift","android"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/sdk"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/analytics-migration-guide/index.mdx","title":"v5 から v6 への移行","description":"Amplify JavaScript v5 から v6 への Analytics API のアップグレード手順について詳しく学習します","platforms":["javascript","react-native","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/analytics-migration-guide"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/data-usage-policy/index.mdx","title":"データ使用ポリシー情報","description":"Amplifyライブラリによって収集されるデータタイプを確認してください。Appleでは、App Storeにアプリを送信する際にアプリのデータ使用ポリシーに開示することが必要です。","platforms":["swift"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/data-usage-policy"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/app-uninstall/index.mdx","title":"アプリのアンインストール","description":"ユーザーがアプリをアンインストールする際にデバイス上の永続データを処理する方法について理解します。","platforms":["swift","android"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics/app-uninstall"}],"title":"Analytics","description":"ユーザーセッション、カスタムユーザー属性、アプリ内メトリクスを追跡するドロップイン分析で情報に基づいた意思決定を行う","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/analytics","lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/index.mdx","children":[{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/set-up-datastore/index.mdx","title":"Amplify DataStore をセットアップ","description":"Amplify DataStore は、オフラインおよびオンラインシナリオのための追加コードを記述することなく、共有および分散データを活用するためのプログラミングモデルを提供します。これにより、分散されたクロスユーザーデータの操作がローカルのみのデータの操作と同じくらい簡単になります。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/set-up-datastore"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/manipulate-data/index.mdx","title":"データの操作","description":"DataStore でデータを保存、クエリ、ページング、更新、削除、監視する方法を学習します。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/manipulate-data"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/relational-models/index.mdx","title":"リレーショナルモデル","description":"DataStoreが'has one'、'has many'、'belongs to'などのモデル間の関係をどのように処理するかについて詳しく学びます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/relational-models"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/sync-to-cloud/index.mdx","title":"クラウドへのデータ同期","description":"DataStoreがAppSyncバックエンドに接続し、GraphQLを使用してローカルに保存されたすべてのデータを自動的に同期する方法について詳しく説明します。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/sync-to-cloud"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/authz-rules-setup/index.mdx","title":"認可ルールの設定","description":"@auth ディレクティブを使用してモデルに認可ルールを適用する方法を学ぶ","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/authz-rules-setup"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/conflict-resolution/index.mdx","title":"コンフリクト解決","description":"DataStore のコンフリクト解決がどのように管理され、どのように設定するかについてさらに詳しく学びます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/conflict-resolution"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/real-time/index.mdx","title":"リアルタイムで観察","description":"DataStore がデータの変更をリアルタイムでどのように処理するかについて詳しく学びます。","platforms":["javascript","react-