":"Amplify DataStoreを使用した完全な例とリソース。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/example-application"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/customize-primary-keys/index.mdx","title":"プライマリキーのカスタマイズ","description":"Amplify DataStoreカテゴリの高度なワークフロー（カスタムプライマリキーを含む）についてさらに詳しく学びます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/customize-primary-keys"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/data-usage-policy/index.mdx","title":"データ使用ポリシー情報","description":"Amplifyライブラリによって収集されるデータ型を確認してください。App Storeにアプリをサブミットするときにアプリのデータ使用ポリシーで開示することがAppleから要求されています。","platforms":["swift"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/data-usage-policy"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/app-uninstall/index.mdx","title":"アプリのアンインストール","description":"ユーザーがアプリをアンインストールする際にデバイス上の永続的なデータを処理する方法について理解します。","platforms":["swift","android"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/app-uninstall"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/index.mdx","children":[{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/set-up-apollo/index.mdx","title":"Apollo Clientのセットアップ","description":"Apollo Clientをインストールし、Cognitoで認証を設定し、エラーハンドリングと再試行ロジックをセットアップし、Amplifyでリアルタイムサブスクリプションを構成し、AppSyncバックエンド用のGraphQL操作を記述します。","platforms":["angular","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2026-05-01T21:54:20.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-