roid","swift"],"lastUpdated":"2026-05-01T21:54:20.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/migrate-datastore-to-apollo"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/migrate-to-api/index.mdx","title":"Amplify APIへの移行","description":"DataStoreの保存、クエリ、削除、監視、およびクエリ監視をFlutterのAmplify API同等品に置き換えます。","platforms":["flutter"],"lastUpdated":"2026-05-01T21:54:20.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/migrate-to-api"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/local-caching/index.mdx","title":"オプション: ローカルキャッシング","description":"FlutterおよびAndroidのDataStoreローカルストレージの代替として、ローカルキャッシングを設定します。","platforms":["android","flutter","swift"],"lastUpdated":"2026-05-01T21:54:20.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/local-caching"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/offline-first/index.mdx","title":"オフラインファースト","description":"リモート同期、ライブ同期、ネットワーク検出、オフラインミューテーションによる完全なオフラインサポートを構築します。","platforms":["android","flutter","swift"],"lastUpdated":"2026-05-01T21:54:20.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/offline-first"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/authorization-and-data/index.mdx","title":"認可とデータ処理","description":"DataStoreからAmplify APIへの移行時に、Flutterの認可ルールを管理し、既存の顧客データを処理します。","platforms":["flutter"],"lastUpdated":"2026-05-01T21:54:20.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/authorization-and-data"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/migrate-from-datastore/disable-conflict-resolution/index.mdx","title":"コンフリクト解決の無効化","description":"AppSync コンフリクト解決を無効